<!-- Visible play mark for the pre-26 launcher icon. The adaptive foreground
     keeps the triangle inside the 66dp safe zone of a 108dp canvas; used raw
     as a legacy icon that padding reads as a nearly blank tile. This glyph
     fills the tile so API 24–25 launchers show a mark, not an empty square. -->
